                            ║ ⚠ Replace the existing deploy key?                           ║                            
                            ║                                                              ║                            
                            ║ The old key stops working at once. The git platform refuses  ║                            
                            ║ this host until the new public key is entered there. This    ║                            
                            ║ cannot be undone.                                            ║                            
                            ║ stack folder: /srv/stacks-example                            ║                            
